{
  "url": "https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/04/05/live-cavern-club-liverpool-168/",
  "type": "history",
  "slug": "live-cavern-club-liverpool-168",
  "title": "5 April 1962: Live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)",
  "date": "1962-04-05",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>This was The Beatles’ 67th evening show at the Cavern Club. They topped a bill which also included The Four Jays (later The Fourmost). <span id=\"more-13936\"></span></p><blockquote><div>This was one of the most fulfilling nights we did at the Cavern. We were chuffed about it: it was the Beatles fan club night and the only bands were The Beatles and The Four Jays. Freda Kelly had asked The Beatles who they wanted and they settled for us. I remember doing ‘Mama Don’t Allow’ with The Beatles. Paul was on piano, John stayed on guitar, I played guitar, we had two drummers with <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo</a> [<em>sic</em>] and Dave Lovelady, and Brian O’Hara brought out an old violin. <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> found an old trumpet and he was blowing that. It sounds good but it was 10 minutes’ worth of crap.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Billy Hatton, The Four Jays<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/leighcavern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>The Cavern</em></a>, Spencer Leigh</div><p><a href=\"/gallery/live/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-28708\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"28708\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"470,373\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Flyer for The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01.jpg\" alt=\"Flyer for The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" width=\"470\" height=\"373\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-28708\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01.jpg 470w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-200x159.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 470px) 100vw, 470px\"></a></p><p>The event was arranged by The Beatles’ Liverpool fan club. The group performed two sets; for the first they wore their old leather jackets and trousers, and changed into their new Beno Dorn suits and ties before the second half.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/04/05/live-cavern-club-liverpool-168/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-13936 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"158\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01-200x158.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01-200x158.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01-580x459.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01-768x608.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01.jpg 855w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28701\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"855,677\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_01.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTYwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE2MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"160\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_02-200x160.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_02-200x160.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_02-580x463.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_02.jpg 756w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28702\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"756,604\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_02.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTYwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE2MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"160\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_03-200x160.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_03-200x160.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_03-580x463.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_03.jpg 745w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28703\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"745,595\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_03.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTczIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE3MyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"173\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_04-200x173.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_04-200x173.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_04-580x503.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_04.jpg 754w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28704\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"754,654\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_04.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_07/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU0IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1NCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"154\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07-200x154.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07-200x154.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07-580x446.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07-768x591.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07.jpg 860w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28707\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"860,662\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_07.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTg0IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE4NCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"184\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06-200x184.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06-200x184.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06-580x535.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06-768x708.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06.jpg 792w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28706\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_06/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"792,730\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_06.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU5IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1OSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"159\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_05-200x159.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_05-200x159.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_05-580x462.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_05.jpg 749w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28705\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1962-photos/620405-beatles-cavern_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"749,597\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern_05.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><blockquote><div><a href=\"/people/brian-epstein/\">Brian Epstein</a> hired the Cavern on a Thursday night in April 1962 and it was for The Beatles to thank their fans and they had The Four Jays as their guests. Because it was a special night, they asked me to sing with them and I said no. On the other hand, [Cavern owner] Ray McFall did two songs with them – the Elvis song ‘Can’t Help Falling In Love’ and the title song of the film <em>Tender Is The Night</em>, which had been recorded by Vic Damone. The Beatles played a few chords behind him and the audience dutifully applauded. He had a good voice and he did well.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/bob-wooler/\">Bob Wooler</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/leighcavern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>The Cavern</em></a>, Spencer Leigh</div><p>The Beatles performed their song ‘The Pinwheel Twist’, <a href=\"/1962/03/22/live-cavern-club-liverpool-157/\">written on 22 March</a> after the group shared a bill with American act Peppy and the New York Twisters. <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> played drums on the song, while <a href=\"/people/pete-best/\">Pete Best</a> twisted on the floor in front of the stage with his girlfriend Kathy, who later became his wife.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/live/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-54742\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI3NjgiIGhlaWdodD0iNjM2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNzY4IDYzNiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"54742\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-2/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,828\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Flyer for The Beatles&amp;#8217; fan club show at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1-960x795.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1-768x636.jpg\" alt=\"Flyer for The Beatles' fan club show at the Cavern Club, Liverpool, 5 April 1962\" width=\"768\" height=\"636\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium_large wp-image-54742\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1-768x636.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1-580x480.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1-960x795.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1-200x166.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/620405-beatles-cavern-flyer_01-1.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"></a></p><p>Overall this was The Beatles’ 168th appearance at the underground Mathew Street venue, including their lunchtime shows. The Cavern’s owner also had a guest spot on stage, singing two songs with The Beatles.</p><blockquote><div>It was good fun but I should have stuck to the one song that they knew. The second song was an unwise choice, but how could they refuse me? I owned the club.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Ray McFall, Cavern Club owner<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/leighcavern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>The Cavern</em></a>, Spencer Leigh</div><p>The precise number of The Beatles’ Cavern performances is not known, although they played at least 155 lunchtime and 125 evening shows between <a href=\"/1961/02/09/live-cavern-club-liverpool/\">9 February 1961</a> and <a href=\"/1963/08/03/live-cavern-club-liverpool-280-final-show/\">3 August 1963</a>.</p><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/OTD?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#OTD</a> 05APR1962  George with his <a href=\"https://twitter.com/GretschUSA?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@GretschUSA</a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/DuoJet?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#DuoJet</a> at a special <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/BeatlesFanClub?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#BeatlesFanClub</a> 'going-away' show <a href=\"https://twitter.com/cavernliverpool?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@cavernliverpool</a> before their upcoming <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/Hamburg?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#Hamburg</a> trip. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/thebeatles?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@thebeatles</a> came onstage first in their black leather outfits, and after a break they changed to their new <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/BenoDorn?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#BenoDorn</a> suits. <a href=\"https://t.co/yZrue0Dso3\">pic.twitter.com/yZrue0Dso3</a></p><p>— George Harrison (@GeorgeHarrison) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/GeorgeHarrison/status/981887561651183616?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 5, 2018</a></p></blockquote><p></p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 3 April 2025</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2025: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2025/04/05/pete-best-announces-retirement/\">Pete Best announces retirement</a></li><li>2019: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2019/04/05/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-tokyo-dome-city-hall-tokyo/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Tokyo Dome City Hall, Tokyo</a></li><li>2017: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2017/04/05/beatles-sgt-pepper-50th-anniversary-edition/\">Full details of The Beatles’ Sgt Pepper 50th anniversary edition</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/04/05/paul-mccartney-live-coliseo-de-puerto-rico-san-juan/\">Paul McCartney live: Coliseo de Puerto Rico, San Juan</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/04/05/paul-mccartney-live-hallam-fm-arena-sheffield/\">Paul McCartney live: Hallam FM Arena, Sheffield</a></li><li>2002: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2002/04/05/paul-mccartney-live-mgm-grand-garden-arena-las-vegas/\">Paul McCartney live: MGM Grand Garden Arena, Las Vegas</a></li><li>1979: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1979/04/05/mixing-to-you-wings-2/\">Mixing: To You by Wings</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/04/05/tape-copying-little-woman-love-get-on-the-right-thing-wings/\">Tape copying: Little Woman Love, Get On The Right Thing by Wings</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/04/05/recording-long-haired-lady-paul-linda-mccartney/\">Recording: Long Haired Lady by Paul and Linda McCartney</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/04/05/ringo-starr-interview-bbc-scene-and-heard-3/\">Ringo Starr is interviewed for the BBC’s Scene And Heard</a></li><li>1967: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/04/05/paul-mccartney-visits-jane-asher-denver/\">Paul McCartney visits Jane Asher in Denver</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/04/05/filming-help-31/\">Filming: Help!</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/05/filming-a-hard-days-night-24/\">Filming: A Hard Day’s Night</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/04/05/the-beatles-receive-their-first-silver-disc/\">The Beatles receive their first silver disc</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/04/05/live-top-ten-club-hamburg-5/\">The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg</a></li><li>1946: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1946/04/05/jane-asher-born/\">Jane Asher is born</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=9e30f016bf398f90c2c1ac3c4d198afb&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=13936&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "This was The Beatles’ 67th evening show at the Cavern Club. They topped a bill which also included The Four Jays (later The Fourmost). This was one of the most fulfilling nights we did at the Cavern. We were chuffed about it: it was the Beatles fan club night and the only bands were The Beatles and The Four Jays. Freda Kelly had asked The Beatles who they wanted and they settled for us. I remember doing ‘Mama Don’t Allow’ with The Beatles. Paul was on piano, John stayed on guitar, I played guitar, we had two drummers with Ringo [sic] and Dave Lovelady, and Brian O’Hara brought out an old violin. George Harrison found an old trumpet and he was blowing that. It sounds good but it was 10 minutes’ worth of crap.Billy Hatton, The Four Jays\nThe Cavern, Spencer LeighThe event was arranged by The Beatles’ Liverpool fan club. The group performed two sets; for the first they wore their old leather jackets and trousers, and changed into their new Beno Dorn suits and ties before the second half.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBrian Epstein hired the Cavern on a Thursday night in April 1962 and it was for The Beatles to thank their fans and they had The Four Jays as their guests. Because it was a special night, they asked me to sing with them and I said no. On the other hand, [Cavern owner] Ray McFall did two songs with them – the Elvis song ‘Can’t Help Falling In Love’ and the title song of the film Tender Is The Night, which had been recorded by Vic Damone. The Beatles played a few chords behind him and the audience dutifully applauded. He had a good voice and he did well.Bob Wooler\nThe Cavern, Spencer LeighThe Beatles performed their song ‘The Pinwheel Twist’, written on 22 March after the group shared a bill with American act Peppy and the New York Twisters. Paul McCartney played drums on the song, while Pete Best twisted on the floor in front of the stage with his girlfriend Kathy, who later became his wife.Overall this was The Beatles’ 168th appearance at the underground Mathew Street venue, including their lunchtime shows. The Cavern’s owner also had a guest spot on stage, singing two songs with The Beatles.It was good fun but I should have stuck to the one song that they knew. The second song was an unwise choice, but how could they refuse me? I owned the club.Ray McFall, Cavern Club owner\nThe Cavern, Spencer LeighThe precise number of The Beatles’ Cavern performances is not known, although they played at least 155 lunchtime and 125 evening shows between 9 February 1961 and 3 August 1963.#OTD 05APR1962  George with his @GretschUSA #DuoJet at a special #BeatlesFanClub 'going-away' show @cavernliverpool before their upcoming #Hamburg trip. @thebeatles came onstage first in their black leather outfits, and after a break they changed to their new #BenoDorn suits. pic.twitter.com/yZrue0Dso3— George Harrison (@GeorgeHarrison) April 5, 2018\nPage last updated: 3 April 2025Also on this day...2025: Pete Best announces retirement2019: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Tokyo Dome City Hall, Tokyo2017: Full details of The Beatles’ Sgt Pepper 50th anniversary edition2010: Paul McCartney live: Coliseo de Puerto Rico, San Juan2003: Paul McCartney live: Hallam FM Arena, Sheffield2002: Paul McCartney live: MGM Grand Garden Arena, Las Vegas1979: Mixing: To You by Wings1972: Tape copying: Little Woman Love, Get On The Right Thing by Wings1971: Recording: Long Haired Lady by Paul and Linda McCartney1970: Ringo Starr is interviewed for the BBC’s Scene And Heard1967: Paul McCartney visits Jane Asher in Denver1965: Filming: Help!1964: Filming: A Hard Day’s Night1963: The Beatles receive their first silver disc1961: The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg1946: Jane Asher is bornWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
